Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: tallystat
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: terminal-based graphical system monitor
 tallystat draws live braille graphs of CPU and memory usage, network
 sparklines, disk usage and I/O, hardware temperatures and a sortable,
 filterable process list, all inside the terminal.
 .
 It is a single small native binary that reads /proc and /sys directly
 and has no dependencies beyond the C library.
